This package contains Turen's bounded, parse-only WebAssembly wrapper for
code-signing and PKI structure inspection.

It embeds unmodified builds of:

- x509-parser (Apache-2.0 OR MIT) — https://github.com/rusticata/x509-parser
- RustCrypto formats crates: cms, der, const-oid, x509-cert, spki, pkcs8,
  x509-ocsp, and friends (Apache-2.0 OR MIT) —
  https://github.com/RustCrypto/formats
- RustCrypto hashes: sha1, sha2, md-5 (Apache-2.0 OR MIT) —
  https://github.com/RustCrypto/hashes
- goblin (MIT) — https://github.com/m4b/goblin
- serde, serde_json, wasm-bindgen and their transitive dependencies
  (Apache-2.0 OR MIT)

All operations are parse-only structural reporting. No signature, trust-chain,
timestamp, or revocation verification is performed, and no network access
occurs.
